    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to help my brother with his startup. he's in the fintech space and he's complaining a ton about all the licensing and compliance stuff slowing him down. can u give me a rundown of the main arguments for and against having heavy regulations in fintech? like what do the people who hate them say vs the people who want them?",
